# Copy to .env and fill in. Bun loads .env automatically — no flag, no dotenv.
NODE_ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=info

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- provider
#
# Which provider to run on: "deepseek" (the code default), "zhipu-cn" or
# "moonshot-cn". Pick ONE of the blocks below and leave the others commented.
#
# ⚠️ `LLM_BASE_URL` and `LLM_MODEL` are per-provider. Switching provider while an
# old value of either is still uncommented is the one way to get this wrong:
# a leftover `LLM_MODEL` fails at startup ("unknown model"), and a leftover
# `LLM_BASE_URL` silently sends the new provider's key to the old provider's host.
# Both come from the registry in `src/models.ts` — normally you set neither.

# --- 智谱 GLM (China region) ---------------------------------------------
# One model, glm-5.3-flash, which is also the default. Base URL comes from the
# registry: https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/coding/paas/v4 — the **Coding Plan**
# path. A balance-billed (pay-as-you-go) account is served from
# https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4 instead, and that is what `LLM_BASE_URL`
# is for; on a Coding Plan key the pay-as-you-go path answers 429 to everything.
# The key must be an open.bigmodel.cn one — an international z.ai key 401s here.
LLM_PROVIDER=zhipu-cn
LLM_ZHIPU_CN_API_KEY=

# --- DeepSeek -------------------------------------------------------------
# Models: deepseek-v4-flash (default) / deepseek-v4-pro.
# LLM_API_KEY still works as the deprecated name for the key below.
# LLM_PROVIDER=deepseek
# LLM_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash

# --- Moonshot (China region) ----------------------------------------------
# Models: kimi-k3 (default) / kimi-k2.7-code / kimi-k2.6. Base URL
# https://api.moonshot.cn/v1 comes from the registry; `/v1` is required, and
# China `.cn` / international `.ai` are two platforms with two key namespaces.
# LLM_PROVIDER=moonshot-cn
# LLM_MOONSHOT_CN_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- escape hatches
# Both default to the selected provider's registry entry. Set them only for a
# proxy, a self-hosted endpoint, or the pay-as-you-go 智谱 path noted above.
# LLM_MODEL=
# LLM_BASE_URL=
